@startuml
title US-073 — Connect a Google account
hide footbox
actor "Student or tutor" as User
participant "Expo Web / Android" as Client
participant "CRM API" as API
participant "Google" as Google
database "SQL Server" as DB

User -> Client : Enter current CRM password and continue
Client -> API : POST /api/users/me/google/challenge\nCRM bearer token
API -> DB : Check active CRM account and save nonce with expiry
API --> Client : 200 with nonce
User -> Client : Continue with Google
Client -> Google : Google Identity Services or Credential Manager\nWeb Client ID and nonce
Google --> Client : Signed Google ID token with sub and nonce
Client -> API : POST /api/users/me/google\nCRM bearer token, ID token and current password
API -> API : Verify Google token and read its sub and nonce
API -> DB : Consume matching unexpired nonce for CRM account
API -> DB : Read active account and password hash
API -> API : Check current CRM password
API -> DB : Save unique link between CRM account ID and Google sub
API --> Client : 204 No Content
Client --> User : Show successful link
@enduml
